  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="codex">
        <pb n="1" facs="#f01" />
        <div n="1" type="scan" subtype="binding">
          <div type="page-face" n="single">
            <ab type="column" n="1" xml:id="f01-s-c01">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">貧人約瑟</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="copy-annotation" corresp="#f01-s-c01">
              <label>封面展覽標籤</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">CENTENNIAL EXHIBITION.／China Protestant Mission.／No 164</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="copy-annotation" corresp="#f01-s-c01">
              <label>封面墨筆</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">637 m</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="copy-annotation" corresp="#f01-s-c01">
              <label>封面鉛筆</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">Sinica 1191／Ser. f. 113／Chin. 637 m</seg>
            </ab>
          </div>
          <div type="editorial-observations">
            <ab type="layout">單幅：黃底書名籤與另貼英文展覽標籤。英文「No」後的「164」為手寫。鉛筆「Ser. f. 113」為候讀。</ab>
            <ab type="transcription-issue" n="single:None">
              <quote>Ser. f. 113</quote>
              <seg type="candidate">113</seg>
              <seg type="candidate">173</seg>
              <note type="editorial">前封橢圓鉛筆中的數字極淡，先採113為候讀。</note>
            </ab>
          </div>
        </div>
        <pb n="2" facs="#f02" />
        <div n="2" type="scan" subtype="binding">
          <div type="page-face" n="right">
            <ab type="no-transcribed-text" />
          </div>
          <div type="page-face" n="left">
            <ab type="column" n="1" xml:id="f02-l-c01">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">　　貧人約瑟</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="2" xml:id="f02-l-c02">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">有貧人、名約瑟、傭工為業、一日偶行倫頓街上、忽聞禮拜</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="3" xml:id="f02-l-c03">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">堂歌詩之聲、遂入焉、見有冠服焜耀者、集而聽道、教師宣</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="4" xml:id="f02-l-c04">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">講使徒保羅達提摩太前書第一章十五節云、有一言可</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="5" xml:id="f02-l-c05">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">信可嘉者、卽基督耶穌臨世救罪人、其中我乃元惡、云云、</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="6" xml:id="f02-l-c06">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">隨卽宣明福音乃可信者之意曰、最惡者、因造化萬物主</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="7" xml:id="f02-l-c07">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">耶穌之功勞、能得永生之救、使徒有云、貌為智為能為貴</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="8" xml:id="f02-l-c08">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">者、不多蒙召、乃上帝選世之不智、以愧智者、選世之不能、</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="9" xml:id="f02-l-c09">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">以愧能者也、維時聽道際、富貴之輩、有心不在焉者、有取</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="10" xml:id="f02-l-c10">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">於口給為悅者、惟約瑟藍縷而立、且奇且喜、目注心傾、歸</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="running-title" corresp="#f02-l-c10">
              <label>左側版心</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">貧人約瑟／一</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="copy-annotation" corresp="#f02-l-c10">
              <label>上緣鉛筆</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">1.</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="seal" corresp="#f02-l-c10">
              <label>下緣圓印</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">BIBLIOTHECA BODLEIANA</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="name-line" corresp="#f02-l-c02">
              <label>第二欄地名旁細長空框</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="black">倫頓</seg>
            </ab>
          </div>
          <div type="editorial-observations">
            <ab type="layout">右面：前封內面無獨立文字，可見透印及殘墨。 左面：人名旁有直線，倫頓旁有細長空框。旁置黑色實點以頓記轉寫，較大的紙孔不轉記。</ab>
          </div>
        </div>
        <pb n="3" facs="#f03" />
        <div n="3" type="scan" subtype="binding">
          <div type="page-face" n="right">
            <ab type="column" n="1" xml:id="f03-r-c01">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">時自語曰、約瑟於斯道、未之前聞也、造萬物之上帝、耶穌</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="2" xml:id="f03-r-c02">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">基督臨世救罪人、如我約瑟者、此乃眞而可信之言也、俄</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="3" xml:id="f03-r-c03">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">而約瑟患瘧疾甚篤、輾轉困頓於牀、常自語曰、約瑟乃罪</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="4" xml:id="f03-r-c04">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">人中之最大者、但耶穌基督臨世救罪人、是教約瑟愛之、</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="5" xml:id="f03-r-c05">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">其鄰人入見其狀、奇其所言、有問之者曰、約瑟爾心有好</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="6" xml:id="f03-r-c06">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">處否、曾受感化否、爾倚賴耶穌而信之否、答曰、約瑟不行</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="7" xml:id="f03-r-c07">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">好、不言己好、乃罪人中之最大者耳、但有可信之言、造萬</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="8" xml:id="f03-r-c08">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">物耶穌臨世救罪人、所以望得救也、有一人知其於聽道</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="9" xml:id="f03-r-c09">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">之時、已受滿心安慰、遂往請教師來見之、教師到時、約瑟</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="10" xml:id="f03-r-c10">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">已甚危殆、不能言語、旁人向彼說知、猶昏沉不醒、教師乃</seg>
            </ab>
          </div>
          <div type="page-face" n="left">
            <ab type="column" n="1" xml:id="f03-l-c01">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">就而與之言、約瑟乍聞其聲、卽時力疾起坐、緊握教師兩</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="2" xml:id="f03-l-c02">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">手、盛氣猛呼曰、先生、爾乃耶穌之友、昔時吾聽爾宣講、耶</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="3" xml:id="f03-l-c03">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">穌係好、約瑟乃罪人中之最大者、但有可信之言、耶穌基</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="4" xml:id="f03-l-c04">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">督卽造萬物者、臨世救罪人、所以約瑟望得救、敢請先生</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="5" xml:id="f03-l-c05">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">代我祈禱、求耶穌救我、稟告他知、約瑟自忖愛耶穌、因其</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="6" xml:id="f03-l-c06">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">臨世救罪人、如我約瑟者之故也、於是教師為之祈禱、旣</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="7" xml:id="f03-l-c07">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">畢、約瑟謝了、隨於枕底取一小囊、內有白金二十、遞送教</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="8" xml:id="f03-l-c08">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">師曰、約瑟本欲積財為養老計、今不獲永生、請將此金分</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="9" xml:id="f03-l-c09">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">贈耶穌貧寒之友、并求說知、約瑟因耶穌臨世救罪人、而</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="10" xml:id="f03-l-c10">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">約瑟乃最大者、所以分財於彼也、說畢遂伏枕而死、如此</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="running-title" corresp="#f03-l-c10">
              <label>左側版心</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">貧人約瑟／二</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="copy-annotation" corresp="#f03-l-c10">
              <label>上緣鉛筆</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">2.</seg>
            </ab>
          </div>
          <div type="editorial-observations">
            <ab type="layout">右面：右側近折口只見版式殘線，左起書頁才有清楚版心。第三欄「瘧」保留候讀。 左面：「係」與「今不獲永生」按原刻保留。</ab>
            <ab type="transcription-issue" n="right:3">
              <quote>瘧</quote>
              <seg type="candidate">瘧</seg>
              <seg type="candidate">瘻</seg>
              <note type="editorial">病名字的疒內有淡損，瘧為候讀。</note>
            </ab>
          </div>
        </div>
        <pb n="4" facs="#f04" />
        <div n="4" type="scan" subtype="author-text">
          <div type="page-face" n="right">
            <ab type="column" n="1" xml:id="f04-r-c01">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">可見約瑟信德之基、卽由此眞理而來、上帝化為人身、以</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="2" xml:id="f04-r-c02">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">救世人、信之者、心內得安慰喜樂、若有罪者、自知己罪、必</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="3" xml:id="f04-r-c03">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">忖惟全能之救主、方能救之、故悔悟而歸向耶穌、因耶穌</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="4" xml:id="f04-r-c04">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">卽恆久可頌之上帝、見其釘十字架無量之功勞、必信之</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="5" xml:id="f04-r-c05">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">而欣喜不勝、倚賴耶穌者必得救。因其血能代信者、滌除</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="6" xml:id="f04-r-c06">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">諸罪、恆在佑之、終不沉淪、無能奪之。</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="7" xml:id="f04-r-c07">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">信福音者、愛上帝、亦愛其民、約瑟受福音之言、非如世人</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="8" xml:id="f04-r-c08">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">之言、乃如上帝大用以救人之言、約瑟受感化而顯見於</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="9" xml:id="f04-r-c09">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">外、乃謂不言己好、彼知使徒所言者眞、謂我愛上帝、因上</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="10" xml:id="f04-r-c10">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">帝先愛我、彼請教師曰、代我祈禱、求耶穌救我、稟告他知、</seg>
            </ab>
          </div>
          <div type="page-face" n="left">
            <ab type="column" n="1" xml:id="f04-l-c01">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">約瑟自忖愛耶穌、因其臨世救罪人、如我者之故也。彼見</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="2" xml:id="f04-l-c02">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">耶穌愛人之心、故熱心愛之、凡受上帝之大恩、必能遵上</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="3" xml:id="f04-l-c03">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">帝之旨、依耶穌之理而行、有如此者。約瑟愛上帝之民、因</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="4" xml:id="f04-l-c04">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">其為耶穌之友、故聽教師聲、乃曰、先生、爾乃耶穌之友、昔</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="5" xml:id="f04-l-c05">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">時吾聽爾宣講、耶穌係好、卽罄囊贈與耶穌貧寒之友、此</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="6" xml:id="f04-l-c06">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">皆其心之實証也。</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="7" xml:id="f04-l-c07">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">夫人之將死、惟福音之道、為能慰其心、然約瑟不以世俗</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="8" xml:id="f04-l-c08">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">之言自慰曰、吾雖無異於吾隣、然有恩憐之上帝、可得救</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="9" xml:id="f04-l-c09">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">也、乃約瑟惟倚賴耶穌贖罪之功勞、故於將死也、而有喜</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="10" xml:id="f04-l-c10">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">樂焉。如聖書云、我儕由信稱義、賴吾主耶穌基督和於上</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="running-title" corresp="#f04-l-c10">
              <label>左側版心</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">貧人約瑟／三</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="printed-small-text" corresp="#f04-l-c10">
              <label>上緣鉛筆</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">3.／ult.</seg>
            </ab>
          </div>
          <div type="editorial-observations">
            <ab type="layout">右面：第六欄止於「之」並留空，下一欄另起。 左面：「實証」按原刻。第六欄止於「也」並留空。</ab>
          </div>
        </div>
        <pb n="5" facs="#f05" />
        <div n="5" type="scan" subtype="author-text">
          <div type="page-face" n="right">
            <ab type="column" n="1" xml:id="f05-r-c01">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">帝、</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="2" xml:id="f05-r-c02">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">夫人之於死、可不謹防哉、然固有一死矣、乃旣死而又有</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="3" xml:id="f05-r-c03">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">訊鞫之事焉、不拜上帝者、不自虞其死者也、宜牢記而勿</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="4" xml:id="f05-r-c04">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">忘之、設今日死、而有所應得之報、請自量其所為、而接受</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="5" xml:id="f05-r-c05">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">福音之教、今有一言可信可嘉者、卽基督耶穌臨世救罪</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="6" xml:id="f05-r-c06">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">人之最惡者、舍此別無他主、蓋天下人間、更無錫他名、可</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="7" xml:id="f05-r-c07">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">以得救、當信主耶穌基督而得救矣。</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="running-title" corresp="#f05-r-c07">
              <label>右側版心</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">〔殘〕／三</seg>
            </ab>
          </div>
          <div type="page-face" n="left">
            <ab type="no-transcribed-text" />
          </div>
